# Trial-Size Trial by Fire (outlands 15), the guard's other operands. A WAR of level 20 at Windurst fame level 2: not
# offered (275 on both talks); accepted by GM, the WAR's trade of the fork: nothing (the SMN test of the trade), and the
# talk is 272 (the accepted arm reads no job). The level side is #level19.
char zone=Kazham pos=100.4,-14.0,-97.7 job=WAR lvl=20
fame Windurst 50
item MiniTuningForkOfFire
login
trigger Dodmos                            # UseFallback 0: the default 275
finish
trigger Dodmos                            # the script: not a SMN: the quest's nil; the default 275
finish
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire accepted
trade Dodmos MiniTuningForkOfFire x1      # not a SMN: nothing
trigger Dodmos                            # the default 275
finish
trigger Dodmos                            # the fork held: 272
finish
